      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 A2V Simple",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 — Audio-to-Video (Simple / Stock nodes)\n\nBased on Deno's A2V approach (youtu.be/puBAu9qt5qM) using **stock** MiniMax H3 R2V only.\n\n### What this does\n1. Load **reference image(s)** for identity / style → `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`\n2. Load **audio** (speech / song) → `<Audio 1>` conditioning\n3. Generate video with lip-sync / performance driven by that audio\n4. **Mux the original audio** into the MP4 (not H3-generated audio)\n\n### How to use\n1. Put image(s) in `ComfyUI/input` and select on Load Image\n2. Put audio (wav/mp3) in `ComfyUI/input` and select on **Load Audio**\n3. Set **Duration** to match the audio section (≈5–15s; snaps to H3 frame grid)\n4. Edit the **Prompt** carefully — H3 needs detailed prompts (template below)\n5. Queue Prompt\n\n### Prompt template (critical)\n```\n[reference generation + audio reference]\nUse <Picture 1> as identity for S1 (same face, hair, outfit). Use <Audio 1> exactly as the performance; S1's lips stay synchronized with every syllable.\nStyle: rendered exactly in the art style of <Picture 1>.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] Medium shot of S1 performing to camera. The singer (S1) sings: <d>[Korean] lyric line</d>\nAt 00:04.000, [Shot 2] slight push-in, natural head motion, mouth articulating clearly.\n\noverall_soundscape: quiet room ambience of the location in <Picture 1>\nnon_diegetic_music: the song from <Audio 1> continues unchanged\n```\n\n### Models\n- Diffusion: `MinimaxH3\\minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- Text: `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n- VAEs: video + audio (audio VAE encodes ref audio)\n\n### Full auto version\nWhisper + Gemma acoustic analysis + LM Studio auto-prompt:\n→ `MiniMax_H3_A2V_AudioToVideo.json` (requires Deno custom nodes)\n\nDocs: https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/minimax/minimax-h3\nVideo: https://youtu.be/puBAu9qt5qM\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
